=== 4. Anchor sensitivity ===
DIF is defined relative to the items assumed clean, so the conclusion is a
function of that assumption. Sweep the anchor size and watch the flag set
move. This is the known trap in this literature and the reason section 2's
choice of four is reported as a choice.

 n_anchor      anchor n_flagged     flagged
        1           2         6 1,4,5,7,8,9
        2         2,6         6 1,4,5,7,8,9
        3       2,6,3         6 1,4,5,7,8,9
        4     2,6,3,1         5   4,5,7,8,9
        5   2,6,3,1,7         4     4,5,8,9
        6 2,6,3,1,7,8         3       4,5,9

Flagged at every anchor size tested: 4,5,9 
(item numbers, per the labels above)
Items that appear and disappear with the anchor are not findings about the
PHQ-9. They are findings about the anchor, and reporting them as the former
is the error this section exists to prevent.

